    <string name="setup_title">Your game files are needed</string>
    <string name="setup_explanation">This app only contains the port\'s own code. To play, you need your own copy of Gears of War 2: the extracted folder that contains default.xex, or the .iso image of your disc.\n\nChoose the folder or the .iso and the app copies or extracts it into its own storage. The game memory-maps its files and Android cannot memory-map files opened through the folder picker, so the copy needs as much free space as the game takes.\n\nYou can also copy the folder yourself, for example over USB from a PC, so that default.xex ends up in:</string>
